I will link it somewhere above here.

00:05:04.180 --> 00:05:06.330
So have a look if this
is of value for you.

00:05:06.330 --> 00:05:08.460
Of course, I need to make
the overall disclaimer

00:05:08.460 --> 00:05:10.140
that this is not investment advice,

00:05:10.140 --> 00:05:11.790
I'm not an investment professional.

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:14.740
So please do your own research
before investing in anything.

00:05:14.740 --> 00:05:16.320
Next, is real estate.

00:05:16.320 --> 00:05:17.340
And maybe you are lucky

00:05:17.340 --> 00:05:19.980
or successful enough to
own some real estate.

00:05:19.980 --> 00:05:22.280
Maybe some apartments or even full houses,

00:05:22.280 --> 00:05:24.470
then I would add each object that you hold

00:05:24.470 --> 00:05:27.750
in a separate line and then
add the value of that object

00:05:27.750 --> 00:05:28.930
in the different columns.

00:05:28.930 --> 00:05:30.810
With assets like this, I would in general,

00:05:30.810 --> 00:05:33.230
assume that the value stays
rather constant over time.

00:05:33.230 --> 00:05:34.730
And then probably every year or so,

00:05:34.730 --> 00:05:36.010
you can just look into it

00:05:36.010 --> 00:05:38.820
and then potentially make
some adjustments as necessary.

00:05:38.820 --> 00:05:40.960
Of course now, if you
purchase real estate,

00:05:40.960 --> 00:05:43.900
you often take a loan, a
mortgage to finance that.

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:45.120
And this is what will come

00:05:45.120 --> 00:05:47.200
into play in the liability section.

00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:49.470
So we're going to talk about
that in a moment as well.

00:05:49.470 --> 00:05:50.710
Next, digital assets.

00:05:50.710 --> 00:05:53.250
Maybe you own some digital
assets like Bitcoin.

00:05:53.250 --> 00:05:55.710
Again, no financial
advice, no recommendation,

00:05:55.710 --> 00:05:57.000
you do your own research.

00:05:57.000 --> 00:05:59.520
But here as well, you could
add each asset that you own

00:05:59.520 --> 00:06:01.310
in the lines and then track the value.

00:06:01.310 --> 00:06:02.470
Personally, I'm quite passionate

00:06:02.470 --> 00:06:04.830
about digital assets and
blockchain technology.

00:06:04.830 --> 00:06:07.510
I made a full video course explaining what

00:06:07.510 --> 00:06:10.010
blockchain technology is
